# ☕ CaféRewards — Loyalty & Rewards Management System

CaféRewards is a full-stack loyalty and rewards management system designed for cafés to manage customers, purchases, loyalty points, membership tiers, rewards, and transaction history.

The application provides a staff-facing interface where staff members can manage loyalty members and perform reward-related operations through a secure REST API.

---

## 🚀 Features

### 🔐 Authentication
- Staff registration
- Staff login
- JWT-based authentication
- Password hashing using bcrypt
- Protected API routes

### 👥 Member Management
- Create new loyalty members
- View all members
- Search members by name or phone number
- Pagination
- Sorting
- View individual member details
- View member points balance
- View transaction history

### 💰 Loyalty Points
- Points are calculated by the backend
- Points are awarded when a purchase is recorded
- Member tier is automatically calculated
- Current points balance is maintained in the database

### 🏆 Membership Tiers

The current reward configuration uses:

| Tier | Qualifying Points | Points Multiplier |
|------|-------------------:|------------------:|
| Bronze | 0 – 499 | 1.0x |
| Silver | 500 – 999 | 1.25x |
| Gold | 1000+ | 1.5x |

> These reward rules are configurable in the backend reward service.

### 🎁 Rewards
- Create rewards
- View active rewards
- Define points required for each reward
- Redeem rewards using loyalty points
- Prevent redemption when the member has insufficient points

### 📊 Transactions
Every purchase or redemption is recorded as a transaction.

Transaction information includes:

- Member
- Transaction type
- Points
- Purchase amount
- Reward
- Balance after transaction
- Timestamp

---

# 🛠️ Technology Stack

## Frontend

- React
- Vite
- JavaScript
- CSS
- Fetch API

## Backend

- Node.js
- Express.js
- REST API
- JWT
- bcryptjs

## Database

- MongoDB
- Mongoose
- MongoDB Atlas

## Development Tools

- Git
- GitHub
- GitHub Codespaces
- VS Code
- Postman / cURL

